    dc:type "resolution-route/none";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: One could compare predictions of specified continuous and discrete fundamental theories against existing high-energy, gravitational, and precision measurements. Agreement or disagreement would assess those theories, but no finite observation directly decides whether nature fundamentally follows a mathematical abstraction.";
