    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/evidenceAgainst> "Continuous and discrete models can be empirically equivalent over accessible scales.", "Fundamentally follows is metaphysical without a distinct observable consequence.", "The claim names no alternative theory with contrasting predictions.";
